;; Use case: opening a publication.
;;
;; A logged-in user opens a publication, to write documents in it: an open publication, in
;; its major 1, with no document, owned by that user. Nobody may open one without being
;; logged in as a known user, an :id is never reused, and a name is taken once per
;; language; the same name in another language is another version of the same publication.
